image bg intro_acceptance = "images/backgrounds/intro_acceptance.png"
image bg intro_apartment = "images/backgrounds/intro_apartment.png"
image bg intro_memories = "images/backgrounds/intro_memories.png"


label intro_setting:

    scene bg intro_acceptance
    with dissolve

    "High school was behind you. You had earned your diploma, a place at college, and a scholarship."

    "For the first time, the next chapter felt like something you could choose for yourself."

    scene bg intro_apartment
    with fade

    "Campus housing was already full. Instead, you found a small apartment just off campus."

    "Your scholarship covered tuition. What remained was barely enough for rent."

    "A part-time job would have to cover the rest."

    "A new town. A place of your own. A chance to decide what came next."

    scene bg intro_memories
    with dissolve

    "But you hadn't left everything behind."

    "Some things came with you. Memories. Relationships. The person you'd been until now."

    "Before deciding who you wanted to become... who were you?"

    window hide
    scene black
    with dissolve

    return